{
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.DodgeEvade": "You manage to shake her hand off thanks to evasion. "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.DodgeFlexibility": "Thanks to your incredibly flexibility, her hand slips off your wrist. "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.DodgeMisdirection": "Using Raphael's technique, you slip freely from her grip."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.DodgeSpeed": "You suddenly jerk your arm away, causing her grip to break."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.Hit": "Before you can react, she launches into the air, propelling the two of you upwards with her powerful wings. You struggle, but it's no use -- until she lets go. You cry out in terror as you fall back to the earth, crashing painfully into a convenient snowbank, while your opponent lands gracefully a few feet away."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.AerialRave.Lead": "The valkyrie charges right at you! You manage to dodge her spear-thrust, but she spins gracefully out of the attack and grabs you by the waist. "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.DodgeBlind": "and step away as you watch the valkyrie's blind bash strikes only air. "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.DodgeEvade": "and you anticipate the upcoming shield bash, dodging her thanks to your incredible evasive ability!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.DodgeFlexibility": "and you use your incredible flexibility to barely fold your body and avoid her shield bash!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.DodgeMisdirection": "and you use technique from Raphael to sidestep and avoid her shield bash!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.DodgeSpeed": "and you successfully dodge her shield bash attack!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.HitLead": "but you leave yourself vulnerable as she spins around and slams her heavy shield into you, knocking you "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.Lead": "The valkyrie feints at you with her longspear; you dodge the blow, "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.NotStunned": "backwards."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.ShieldBash.Stunned": "off balance."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.DodgeBlind": "and step away as you watch the valkyrie's blind attacks strike only air. "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.DodgeEvade": "and you anticipate the upcoming spear strikes, dodging her attacks thanks to your incredible evasive ability!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.DodgeFlexibility": "and you use your incredible flexibility to barely fold your body and avoid her attacks!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.DodgeMisdirection": "and you use technique from Raphael to sidestep and completely avoid her barrage of attacks!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.DodgeSpeed": "and you successfully dodge her barrages of spear attacks!"
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.Hit": "but she follows through with a rapid flurry of spear strikes, tearing into your flesh."
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.Lead": "The valkyrie lunges at you, jabbing with her longspear. You dodge the first attack easily, "
  "Combat.Valkyrie.SpearAttack.Parry": "and you successfully parry her barrage of spear attacks!"
}
